{"5350770":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Darts With Mates","steam_appid":5350770,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your pub. Your mates. One more round.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Darts With Mates is a 1–4 player first-person darts party game built for nights with friends.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Host a private pub night, throw every dart yourself, go head-to-head in 501 or High Score, or team up for <strong>2v2<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between throws, you're free to roam the pub, grab a drink, change the music and watch your mates either hit the double — or miss spectacularly.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1–4 players<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Private online matches with <strong>Steam friends<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1v1 and <strong>2v2 team play<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KILLER 1-4 players <strong>last man standing<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CRICKET close the numbers<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player against pub regulars<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >501 with double-out and High Score<br> <\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5350770\/extras\/02531dafad78e1ebb1f412ecc1b26529.poster.avif?t=1793739696\" width=780 height=484 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5350770\/extras\/02531dafad78e1ebb1f412ecc1b26529.webm?t=1793739696\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5350770\/extras\/02531dafad78e1ebb1f412ecc1b26529.mp4?t=1793739696\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based first-person dart throwing <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lively pub to explore between turns <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional drinking — staying sober is always an option <\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Throw every dart yourself<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Line up the dart, draw back, flick forward and let go. Timing and movement matter, from your first single to the double you need to win.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every dart is yours to throw.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Settle it at the board<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Count down from 501 with a double-out finish, or chase the highest total in High Score.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo against the house regulars or invite up to three Steam friends into your pub. Compete head-to-head, play with up to four players, or split into teams for <strong>2v2<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players waiting for their turn are free to roam the pub instead of simply staring at the scoreboard.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5350770\/extras\/5668f7ea1f49c323ae27c72e6b2613ef.poster.avif?t=1793739696\" width=780 height=484 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5350770\/extras\/5668f7ea1f49c323ae27c72e6b2613ef.webm?t=1793739696\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5350770\/extras\/5668f7ea1f49c323ae27c72e6b2613ef.mp4?t=1793739696\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make the pub your own evening<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While your mate throws, head to the bar, change the music, watch the next dart land or find something else to do around the pub.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tonight's League<\/strong> keeps track of your friend-match wins and best 501 leg. Beat the pub record and earn the gold cowboy hat.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order a pint, offer your glass to a friend, raise a toast or choose something alcohol-free. Drinking is always optional.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A steady hand is always welcome<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the whole night sober if you want.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you choose to drink, your character's balance and aim gradually become harder to manage. Your opponent's drinks never affect your controls, and alcohol never increases your score.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camera effects can be reduced or switched off while keeping the gameplay challenge intact.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5350770\/extras\/db84b052e75daf3772262eda7dc302c3.poster.avif?t=1793739696\" width=780 height=484 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5350770\/extras\/db84b052e75daf3772262eda7dc302c3.webm?t=1793739696\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5350770\/extras\/db84b052e75daf3772262eda7dc302c3.mp4?t=1793739696\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The pub notices<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A great throw, a painful bust or a dart landing somewhere it absolutely shouldn't gives the room something to react to.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the rematch and give your mate another chance to explain what they were trying to do.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your pub. Your mates. One more round.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Darts With Mates is a 1–4 player first-person darts party game built for nights with friends.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Host a private pub night, throw every dart yourself, go head-to-head in 501 or High Score, or team up for <strong>2v2<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between throws, you're free to roam the pub, grab a drink, change the music and watch your mates either hit the double — or miss spectacularly.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1–4 players<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Private online matches with <strong>Steam friends<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1v1 and <strong>2v2 team play<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KILLER 1-4 players <strong>last man standing<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CRICKET close the numbers<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player against pub regulars<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >501 with double-out and High Score<br> <\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5350770\/extras\/02531dafad78e1ebb1f412ecc1b26529.poster.avif?t=1793739696\" width=780 height=484 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5350770\/extras\/02531dafad78e1ebb1f412ecc1b26529.webm?t=1793739696\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5350770\/extras\/02531dafad78e1ebb1f412ecc1b26529.mp4?t=1793739696\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based first-person dart throwing <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lively pub to explore between turns <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional drinking — staying sober is always an option <\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Throw every dart yourself<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Line up the dart, draw back, flick forward and let go. Timing and movement matter, from your first single to the double you need to win.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every dart is yours to throw.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Settle it at the board<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Count down from 501 with a double-out finish, or chase the highest total in High Score.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo against the house regulars or invite up to three Steam friends into your pub. Compete head-to-head, play with up to four players, or split into teams for <strong>2v2<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players waiting for their turn are free to roam the pub instead of simply staring at the scoreboard.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5350770\/extras\/5668f7ea1f49c323ae27c72e6b2613ef.poster.avif?t=1793739696\" width=780 height=484 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5350770\/extras\/5668f7ea1f49c323ae27c72e6b2613ef.webm?t=1793739696\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5350770\/extras\/5668f7ea1f49c323ae27c72e6b2613ef.mp4?t=1793739696\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make the pub your own evening<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While your mate throws, head to the bar, change the music, watch the next dart land or find something else to do around the pub.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tonight's League<\/strong> keeps track of your friend-match wins and best 501 leg. Beat the pub record and earn the gold cowboy hat.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order a pint, offer your glass to a friend, raise a toast or choose something alcohol-free. Drinking is always optional.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A steady hand is always welcome<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the whole night sober if you want.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you choose to drink, your character's balance and aim gradually become harder to manage. Your opponent's drinks never affect your controls, and alcohol never increases your score.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camera effects can be reduced or switched off while keeping the gameplay challenge intact.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5350770\/extras\/db84b052e75daf3772262eda7dc302c3.poster.avif?t=1793739696\" width=780 height=484 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5350770\/extras\/db84b052e75daf3772262eda7dc302c3.webm?t=1793739696\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5350770\/extras\/db84b052e75daf3772262eda7dc302c3.mp4?t=1793739696\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The pub notices<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A great throw, a painful bust or a dart landing somewhere it absolutely shouldn't gives the room something to react to.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the rematch and give your mate another chance to explain what they were trying to do.<\/p>","short_description":"Darts With Mates is a darts party game for 1–4 players. Host a pub night with Steam friends, play 501, Killer, High Score or Pub Bingo, team up in 2v2, and grab a pint or stay sober between throws.","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Danish, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Swedish, Traditional Chinese, Czech, Dutch, Finnish, Greek, Indonesian, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Spanish - Latin America, Turkish","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5350770\/15e3b1e49646c5641c49cfc922cef43cc33aaa5c\/header.jpg?t=1793739696","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5350770\/3d9e429b206483c33e70ed940e36b7dbbf1fbbf1\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793739696","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5350770\/3d9e429b206483c33e70ed